*saccept* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''saccept(serverHandle)''

Accepts an incoming connection on a listening socket.

*Parameters:*
- ''serverHandle'': Socket handle

*Returns:*
- Number: New socket handle for the accepted client connection
- ''err'' on failure

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if serverHandle is not a number
- Runtime error if serverHandle is invalid
- Runtime error if socket is not in listening mode
- Runtime error if listening socket is closed
